OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity slavery probe
OL,4,A'scratching the surface'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials and donors involved in the
OL,7,Fearly history of Durham University had
OL,8,Flinks to slavery, a report by the
OL,9,Finstitution has found.
OL,11,FThe university, the third oldest in
OL,12,FEngland, was founded in 1832 by the
OL,13,FChurch of England two years before the
OL,14,Fabolition of slavery.
OL,16,FMany linked to the university in the
OL,17,F19th Century received compensation from
OL,18,Fthe UK government for the loss of their
OL,19,Fslaves, including board member James
OL,20,FEllice, who co-owned a Grenadian
OL,21,Fplantation.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
