OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity slavery probe
OL,4,A'scratching the surface'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe university called the report a
OL,7,F"foundation" for further reflection,
OL,8,Fwhile slavery researcher Dr Andrea
OL,9,FLivesey, at Liverpool John Moores
OL,10,FUniversity, said: "The important
OL,11,Fquestion is now what the university
OL,12,Fdoes with its findings."
